**CXL3.0引入Back Inv**

[https://0x10.sh/back-invalidate-in-cxl-3-0](https://0x10.sh/back-invalidate-in-cxl-3-0)

**访问host内存(包含Host Bias下device内存)**时，发出**Back Inv**申请无效化其他副本，而**不需要CXL.cache**向host申请，因此**一致性维护完全由每个节点承担，能扩展到多host的统一内存空间**；

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2083.png)

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2084.png)

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2085.png)

