# CXL挑战、问题

CXL内存访问**延迟**比DDR访问更大,需要**分层存储**管理;

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2091.png)

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2092.png)

CXL访问延迟可能难以满足QoS,CXL动态资源调度考虑资源利用率,还需要**考虑QoS**;

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2093.png)

![image.png](CXL%E5%88%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/image%2094.png)